          "why": "A tall photo card with title, three-line description, two tags and a price with one action: the system card for a priced listing",
          "alternatives": [
            {
              "component": "DestinationCard",
              "rejected": "rating and Book now, for places"
            },
            {
              "component": "MiniDestination",
